#: ../who-iris/processes/iris-cdn-sign-publish.bpmn:75
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A signature on each library item: items/<handle>/manifest-sha256.txt lists the item record and its files; its detached JWS sits beside it. Only items whose manifest bytes changed are signed: ES256 is randomised, so re-signing an unchanged item would be churn. The item manifests and their signatures join the payload, so the tag files are refreshed to cover them before the release is signed."
msgstr ""

#: ../who-iris/processes/iris-cdn-sign-publish.bpmn:49
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Anyone. Resolves the key from the did:web DID document, never from the package, and checks its x5c chain up to WHO's signing key. Cannot reach it: the verdict is unknown, not verified."
msgstr ""

